The project isnt being deployed yet so here is the steps to run the project.

What you need installed:
XAMPP (we use it for Apache and MySQL)
Node.js
Python 3
ngrok
VS Code (any editor works, but this is what we used)

First start the apache and MySQL from  xampp.
Open the frontend and the backend folders in two separate VS Code windows. In each one, open a terminal and run:
The chatbot is hosted on Landbot, so it can't reach our backend on localhost directly. We use ngrok to give the backend a temporary public URL.
open ngrok and run this command ngrok http 5001. 
Open the ml folder and type in terminal py ml_api.py.

Why isn't it deployed?
We plan to replace the Landbot chatbot with one we build ourselves using NLP, so the student can actually talk to it in normal language instead of clicking through buttons. 
We'd rather deploy once with the new chatbot than deploy twice.
